5␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀M0␀␀␀ ␀U(␀␀␀␀␀␀␀a␀␀M©␀␀g)a␀␀First step on a shortest path from start to any goal cell.

Returns (direction, path_length, goal), (None, 0, start) if start is already
a goal, or None if no goal is reachable.  Obstacles are all objects; with
