      W   d   d   r   r   r   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   v   v   d   d   W
      W   d   d   r   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   O   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   r   r   r   d   r   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   r   d   r   r   r   n   d   r   d   n   d   r   L   r   d   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   t   .   .   |   d   d   W   L   W   d   d   O   r   d   d   W   W   W   r   c   ^   :   d   W
      W   d   .   A   .   +   v   d   W   L   W   d   d   d   O   r   d   W   W   W   .   .   :   :   :   W
      W   d   .   .   ^   t   v   O   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   r   r   W   W   W   |   .   +   E   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   v   d   d   d   d   v   W   W   W   d   v   c   r   d   W
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
    # Cave-In Crossing | Three carts, a hanging boulder and a lava gate.
    - |
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
      W   d   d   d   d   r   r   r   r   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   r   d   O   d   W
      W   d   d   d   ^   |   d   r   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   r   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   O   r   r   d   d   W
      W   d   d   :   +   :   d   d   r   W   O   W   r   d   d   v   d   d   d   W   W   W   O   d   d   r   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   A   .   *   .   d   n   d   d   d   n   v   d   v   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   L   r   O   d   W
      W   v   t   ^   .   o   .   r   r   W   W   W   d   v   d   d   d   d   v   W   W   W   d   r   L   L   L   r   d   W
      W   d   d   d   t   *   d   r   d   W   W   W   d   O   d   d   d   r   r   W   W   W   d   r   r   L   r   v   d   W
      W   d   d   O   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   _   +   d   r   d   W   W   W   d   r   d   r   d   v   d   W
      W   d   d   d   O   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   |   _   _   _   |   v   r   W   W   W   O   r   O   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   O   d   W   W   W   :   _   o   .   .   v   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   O   d   W
      W   d   d   d   r   O   d   d   d   W   W   W   :   f   .   t   .   d   d   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   d   d   r   W
      W   d   d   r   L   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   .   .   r   d   d   W   W   W   r   d   v   d   d   r   r   W
      W   d   r   L   L   L   r   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   d   r   O   O   W   W   W   d   d   v   d   d   r   r   W
      W   d   O   r   L   r   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   r   r   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   d   v   d   c   d   d   W
      W   O   d   d   r   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   r   r   d   d   n   d   r   d   n   _   f   :   :   c   |   W
      W   d   O   d   d   d   v   d   v   W   W   W   O   r   L   L   r   d   d   W   L   W   d   _   ^   :   :   +   d   W
      W   d   d   r   d   d   v   d   v   W   W   W   d   d   r   r   O   d   O   W   L   W   d   v   c   :   +   E   d   W
      W   r   r   r   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
    # The Deep Lift | Three gates, four chambers: ration your stamina and timber.
    - |
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   O   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   O   d   r   r   W   W   W   d   r   d   d   W
      W   O   O   d   d   d   O   d   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   O   d   r   r   r   W   W   W   d   r   r   d   W
      W   d   d   d   r   r   d   d   W   W   W   |   r   r   r   d   W   W   W   r   O   d   f   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   r   v   v   W   W   W   :   o   *   r   d   W   W   W   r   d   r   d   d   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   r   r   r   d   d   W   W   W   f   :   :   r   n   d   r   d   n   d   r   d   v   W   W   W   v   v   v   d   W
      W   d   r   L   L   L   r   d   W   W   W   :   :   t   d   d   W   L   W   d   d   d   d   v   W   W   W   d   d   v   d   W
      W   d   d   r   r   r   d   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   r   W   L   W   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   r   O   v   W
      W   d   d   r   d   d   r   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   r   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   d   d   d   W
      W   d   d   r   r   d   d   v   W   W   W   v   O   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   r   W   W   W   d   d   r   O   W
      W   O   r   r   v   d   d   d   W   W   W   v   v   O   d   d   W   W   W   |   .   f   d   r   W   W   W   O   r   r   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   v   d   d   d   W   W   .   .   .   .   +   d   W   O   W   d   d   d   r   W
      W   r   r   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   O   O   d   r   d   W   W   W   ^   o   +   d   n   d   d   d   n   d   d   r   W
      W   r   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   r   r   r   L   r   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   |   f   d   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   O   W   d   r   r   r   d   W   W   W   v   d   d   O   O   W   W   W   .   ^   .   d   W
      W   d   |   .   _   :   d   n   d   d   d   n   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   v   r   r   r   d   W   W   ^   :   +   c   .   W
      W   d   d   _/A .   :   ^   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   f   O   W   W   W   r   L   L   L   r   W   W   W   :   +   *   O   W
      W   d   d   +   _   t   r   r   W   W   W   O   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   r   r   r   d   W   W   W   c   E   c   r   W
      W   d   d   d   d   d   d   d   W   W   W   d   v   v   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   v   d   d   W   W   W   d   d   d   d   W
      W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W   W

Actions:
  - Name: face
    InputMapping:
      Internal: true
      Inputs:
        2: {Description: Face down, VectorToDest: [0, 0], MetaData: {facing: 2}}
    Behaviours:
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}]}
        Dst: {Object: miner}

  # Ore carts count themselves into the level goal at reset.
  - Name: count_goal
    InputMapping:
      Internal: true
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: Count, VectorToDest: [0, 0]}
    Behaviours:
      - Src: {Object: cart, Commands: [{incr: carts_needed}]}
        Dst: {Object: cart}

  # Gravity: every boulder checks the cell south of it. With room to fall it wobbles (falling=2) for 4
  # ticks, then rolls one cell per tick (falling=1) until blocked. A rolling boulder crushes the miner.
  - Name: fall
    InputMapping:
      Internal: true
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: South, VectorToDest: [0, 1]}
    Behaviours:
      - Src:
          Object: boulder
          Preconditions: [{eq: [src.falling, 0]}]
          Commands: [{set: [falling, 2]}, {set_tile: 1}, {exec: {Action: fall, ActionId: 1, Delay: 4}}]
        Dst: {Object: [_empty, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, tunnel]}
      - Src:
          Object: boulder
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.falling, 1]}]
          Commands: [{mov: _dest}, {set: [falling, 1]}, {set_tile: 1}, {exec: {Action: fall, ActionId: 1, Delay: 1}}]
        Dst: {Object: [_empty, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, tunnel]}
      - Src:
          Object: boulder
          Preconditions: [{eq: [src.falling, 1]}]
          Commands: [{exec: {Action: fall, ActionId: 1, Delay: 2}}]
        Dst: {Object: miner, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src:
          Object: boulder
          Preconditions: [{neq: [src.falling, 1]}]
          Commands: [{set: [falling, 0]}, {set_tile: 0}, {exec: {Action: fall, ActionId: 1, Delay: 2}}]
        Dst: {Object: miner}
      - Src: {Object: boulder, Commands: [{set: [falling, 0]}, {set_tile: 0}, {exec: {Action: fall, ActionId: 1, Delay: 2}}]}
        Dst: {Object: [water, tree, bush, rock, hedge, stone, tombstone, torch, bedrock, dirt_block, rock_block, vein, boulder, lava, ore, timber, ration, cart, cart_full, lift, beam]}

  # Lava oozes into neighbouring dug tunnels (never onto natural cave floor) and burns the miner.
  - Name: flow
    InputMapping:
      Internal: true
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: West, VectorToDest: [-1, 0]}
        2: {Description: North, VectorToDest: [0, -1]}
        3: {Description: East, VectorToDest: [1, 0]}
        4: {Description: South, VectorToDest: [0, 1]}
    Behaviours:
      - Src: {Object: lava, Commands: [{spawn: lava}, {exec: {Action: flow, Delay: 7, Randomize: true}}]}
        Dst: {Object: tunnel}
      - Src: {Object: lava, Commands: [{exec: {Action: flow, Delay: 7, Randomize: true}}]}
        Dst: {Object: miner, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src: {Object: lava, Commands: [{exec: {Action: flow, Delay: 7, Randomize: true}}]}
        Dst: {Object: [water, tree, bush, rock, hedge, stone, tombstone, torch, bedrock, dirt_block, rock_block, vein, boulder, lava, ore, timber, ration, cart, cart_full, lift, beam, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, _empty]}

  # The miner walks up / down / left / right. Walking into loose ore, timber or a ration picks it up,
  # into an empty cart with 3 ore fills it, into the lift (all carts full) wins, and into a boulder
  # from the east or west shoves it.
  - Name: move
    InputMapping:
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: Left, VectorToDest: [-1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 3}}
        2: {Description: Up, VectorToDest: [0, -1], MetaData: {facing: 0}}
        3: {Description: Right, VectorToDest: [1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 1}}
        4: {Description: Down, VectorToDest: [0, 1], MetaData: {facing: 2}}
    Behaviours:
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {mov: _dest}]}
        Dst: {Object: [_empty, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, tunnel, beam]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {mov: _dest}, {incr: ore}, {reward: 1}]}
        Dst: {Object: ore, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {mov: _dest}, {add: [timber, 2]}]}
        Dst: {Object: timber, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {mov: _dest}, {add: [stamina, 15]}]}
        Dst: {Object: ration, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.ore, 3]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {sub: [ore, 3]}, {reward: 5}]
        Dst: {Object: cart, Commands: [{decr: carts_needed}, {change_to: cart_full}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{lte: [carts_needed, 0]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {reward: 10}]
        Dst: {Object: lift, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{neq: [meta.facing, 0]}, {neq: [meta.facing, 2]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {cascade: _dest}, {mov: _dest}]
        Dst: {Object: boulder}
      - Src: {Object: boulder, Commands: [{mov: _dest}]}
        Dst: {Object: [_empty, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, tunnel]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
        Dst: {Object: lava}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}]}
        Dst: {Object: [water, tree, bush, rock, hedge, stone, tombstone, torch, bedrock, dirt_block, rock_block, vein, cart, cart_full, lift]}

  # Swing the pickaxe at the block in front (the UI sends the last move direction). Costs 1 stamina.
  - Name: dig
    InputMapping:
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: Left, VectorToDest: [-1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 3}}
        2: {Description: Up, VectorToDest: [0, -1], MetaData: {facing: 0}}
        3: {Description: Right, VectorToDest: [1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 1}}
        4: {Description: Down, VectorToDest: [0, 1], MetaData: {facing: 2}}
    Behaviours:
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.stamina, 1]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {decr: stamina}, {spawn: tunnel}]
        Dst: {Object: dirt_block, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.stamina, 1]}, {gte: [dst.hp, 2]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {decr: stamina}]
        Dst: {Object: rock_block, Commands: [{decr: hp}, {set_tile: 1}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.stamina, 1]}, {lte: [dst.hp, 1]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {decr: stamina}, {spawn: tunnel}]
        Dst: {Object: rock_block, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.stamina, 1]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {decr: stamina}, {incr: ore}, {reward: 1}, {spawn: tunnel}]
        Dst: {Object: vein, Commands: [{remove: true}]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}]}
        Dst: {Object: [water, tree, bush, rock, hedge, stone, tombstone, torch, bedrock, dirt_block, rock_block, vein, boulder, lava, ore, timber, ration, cart, cart_full, lift, beam, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, _empty, tunnel]}

  # Put a support beam into the free cell in front (costs 1 timber).
  - Name: build
    InputMapping:
      Inputs:
        1: {Description: Left, VectorToDest: [-1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 3}}
        2: {Description: Up, VectorToDest: [0, -1], MetaData: {facing: 0}}
        3: {Description: Right, VectorToDest: [1, 0], MetaData: {facing: 1}}
        4: {Description: Down, VectorToDest: [0, 1], MetaData: {facing: 2}}
    Behaviours:
      - Src:
          Object: miner
          Preconditions: [{gte: [src.timber, 1]}]
          Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}, {decr: timber}, {spawn: beam}]
        Dst: {Object: [_empty, grass, moss, dirt, sand, bones, mushroom, skull, bridge, tunnel]}
      - Src: {Object: miner, Commands: [{set_tile: meta.facing}]}
        Dst: {Object: [water, tree, bush, rock, hedge, stone, tombstone, torch, bedrock, dirt_block, rock_block, vein, boulder, lava, ore, timber, ration, cart, cart_full, lift, beam]}

Objects:
  - Name: grass
    MapCharacter: ","
    Z: 0
    Observers:
      Sprite2D: &grass_sprite
        - TilingMode: WALL_16
          Image:
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_0.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_1.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_2.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_3.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_4.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_5.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_6.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_7.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_8.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_9.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_10.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_11.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_12.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_13.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_14.png
            - gvgai/oryx/grass_15.png
      FollowCam: *grass_sprite
      CloseUp: *grass_sprite
      Isometric: &grass_iso
        - Image: oryx/oryx_iso_dungeon/grass-1.png
          TilingMode: ISO_FLOOR
      IsoFollow: *grass_iso
      Block2D:
        - Shape: square
          Color: [0.25, 0.55, 0.25]
          Scale: 0.9
  - Name: moss
    MapCharacter: ";"
    Z: 0
    Observers:
      Sprite2D: &moss_sprite
        - Image: oryx/oryx_tiny_galaxy/tg_sliced/tg_world/tg_world_floor_moss_a.png
      FollowCam: *moss_sprite
      CloseUp: *moss_sprite
      Isometric: &moss_iso
        - Image: oryx/oryx_iso_dungeon/floor-2.png
          TilingMode: ISO_FLOOR
      IsoFollow: *moss_iso
      Block2D:
        - Shape: square
          Color: [0.25, 0.4, 0.2]
          Scale: 0.9
  - Name: dirt
    MapCharacter: ":"
    Z: 0
    Observers:
      Sprite2D: &dirt_sprite
        - Image: oryx/oryx_tiny_galaxy/tg_sliced/tg_world/tg_world_floor_dirt_a.png
      FollowCam: *dirt_sprite
      CloseUp: *dirt_sprite
      Isometric: &dirt_iso
        - Image: remastered/iso-dirt.png
          TilingMode: ISO_FLOOR
      IsoFollow: *dirt_iso
      Block2D:
        - Shape: square
          Color: [0.3, 0.22, 0.15]
          Scale: 0.9
  - Name: sand
    MapCharacter: "_"
    Z: 0
    Observers:
      Sprite2D: &sand_sprite
        - Image: oryx/oryx_tiny_galaxy/tg_sliced/tg_world/tg_world_floor_sand_a.png
      FollowCam: *sand_sprite
      CloseUp: *sand_sprite
      Isometric: &sand_iso
        - Image: remastered/iso-sand.png
          TilingMode: ISO_FLOOR
      IsoFollow: *sand_iso
      Block2D:
        - Shape: square
          Color: [0.7, 0.55, 0.3]
          Scale: 0.9
  - Name: bones
    MapCharacter: "+"
    Z: 0
    Observers:
      Sprite2D: &bones_sprite
