    # Slime Kingdom | Two Kings and four gem orders. Rule the ranch!
    - |
      &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &   &
